  "historyNote": "#4442, eff 7-1-88; amd by #4906, eff 8-10-90; amd by #5122, eff 4-25-91, EXPIRED 4-25-97 New. #6617, eff 10-25-97; ss by #8453, INTERIM, eff 10-25-05, EXPIRED: 4-23-06 New. #8693, eff 7-27-06; ss by #10759, eff 1-17-15; amd by #12609, eff 8-23-18; ss by #14178, INTERIM, eff 1-18-25; ss by #14490, eff 1-22-26, EXPIRES: 1-22-36",
